<title>CANADA: Exall files for normal course bid.</title>
<headline>Exall files for normal course bid.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Exall Resources Ltd said on Thursday it has filed to make a normal course issuer bid through the facilities of the Toronto Stock Exchange for up to 10 percent of its public float.</p>
<p>The bid, which is subject to appropriate regulatory approvals, will begin on February 24 and end on February 23, 1998.</p>
<p>Under the filing, the mining and mineral exploration company may acquire up to 1.99 million common shares. The company said it was initiating the issuer bid because the shares represent attractive values at these levels.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
